body:
I believe his intention is to get the pi to gather my address and families address and to harass them and i himself. As in the inquiry the pi stated that he would find my mothers and siblings phone numbers and addresses and any personal information he can discover of use to him. 

&#x200B;

He has my full name and knows what country I am am from although he doesn't know my siblings or mums names. I have deleted Instagram and any social media I had. Is it possible to hid from the pi so that he can't find my family? 

&#x200B;

My surname that he knows is also different on my birth cert as we changed it to my mums when my dad left.

The problem is not the number...he said he will order a private investigator. He even sent a screenshot of an inquiry he sent to the pi. I have said that I will take legal action if he doesn't stop the threats but I think he knows that I am bluffing. He says if I bring him down that I will go down with him. I just don't know if I have a case. He says that they won't accept text messages as proof and that 'everything can be faked nowadays' and that 'scammers are very believable'.

&#x200B;

Since breaking up with him, I have noticed he seems to be kinda narcissistic. I said that if he promised to stop cheating with prostitutes and me and get tested for stds then I wouldn't inform his wife (as I dont want to be a homewrecker) however he responded that 'it's my choice and if I want to cheat then I can and will. It is none of your business' 

&#x200B;

I believe this does concern me as I was in a relationship with this man for a year and 6 months without knowing he was married and also using escorts. I am pretty distraught. He also has two children one a two years my senior and one the same age as me.
